    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist &quot;Anime Collector: Evo&quot;</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/df63f6c3988aee575325dd07994d1c08.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div></p><br><h1>JOIN OUR DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/503ff006fbf555336695331214cd619d.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br>EVO, a city of hopes and dreams where reputation, worth, and status are displayed through your collection of unique artworks and items. Join the world of Anime Collector:Evo (today) for free and forge your own path to virtual wealth.<br><br>Explore the massive city of Evo and discover its secrets with a friend or on your own. Claim items via quests, Win items with minigames. Speak to NPCs and discover riches that have not been discovered yet and then at the end of the day buy a home and furnish it with any item that you have claimed in Evo.<br><br>Can you make it to the top? Can you find the legendary items that Evo has waiting to be discovered?<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/bc513e47b2320a004a6c065ad12a71dd.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All items rewarded are marketable and tradable.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/94b67ccbfddd0862f878e4bbc9bc92e0.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/9bb4ec0f823589b4b14e87a92202675c.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Slot Machine<br></li><li>Lottery<br></li><li>Player Bets</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/f4e6e577b3c81a078f1c8f257a14942c.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Purchase land or a Home and invite friends to visit!(Coming Soon)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/fa96d07a7c0fe0a73d6096985b4416fa.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Take on quests to discover new art or items. The more difficult the quest the rarer the item that you may potentially earn.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/2ee1f1a30ada48212dc567f5d55958f6.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Speak to NPCs to start quests. Some NPCs may just want a chat, Some may even tell you locations of legendary items that require you to gather items or complete tasks.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/ca0e72c367469f4da6a8ef0100a24082.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Defeat rare monsters to gather their loot.</li></ul><strong>Modular Weapon System</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Collect different ranged weapon modules to truly make a weapon that suits you. The rarer the weapon module the more powerful it is!</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/ad1b4dc2ed989f4bfff95e33cbb6ef77.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/151035dcf898e4cc7f367e14adc1b92b.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every single monster inside of EVO can be tamed and trained to fight by your side!(Coming Soon)</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1464540/extras/511b093508c034fee72da16c167e3219.avif?t=1751952624\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Little cosmetic friends that follow you to the end of the earth!</li></ul>",
